  "description": "Independent second path to the free-config chi^lambda(beta_free), by the Frobenius characteristic map: expand each nucleon's degree-3 symmetric function in the power-sum basis (where multiplication is concatenation), then convert back with Murnaghan-Nakayama. Forms no Littlewood-Richardson coefficient, so it is independent of chi_free_via_lr in ALGORITHM -- both read the same six cached nucleon characters, so this catches a combinatorial error, not a bad input. Exists so the carrier probe's 6Li assertion can be a validation rather than a regression pin.",
